ite_admin": false}, "body": "I increased the Awaitility wait in `AbstractAsyncThreadContextTestBase` from 500 ms to 5 seconds to avoid a timing flake where the async logger ring buffer was not freed quickly enough on some machines. This is a minimal, test only change that keeps the same assertions but gives more time for slow or busy CI runners, especially on Windows. Five seconds should absorb temporary scheduling or I/O delays while keeping tests fast. We can adjust the timeout or make it configurable later if needed.\r\n\r\nFixes #3005.\r\n", "labels": [{"id": 5005336671, "node_id": "LA_kwDOAKJSSM8AAAABKldgXw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/logging-log4j2/labels/tests", "name": "tests", "description": "Pull requests or issues related to tests", "color": "56BC5A", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 6087683095, "node_id": "LA_kwDOAKJSSM8AAAABatqsFw", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/logging-log4j2/labels/async", "name": "async", "description": "Affects asynchronous loggers or appenders", "color": "7B9FAC", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 12198109965, "node_id": "LA_kwDOAKJSSM8AAAAC1xBjDQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/logging-log4j2/labels/port-done", "name": "port-done", "description": "No further port needed: all required ports are merged, or none was needed", "color": "0e8a16", "default": false, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2025-10-17T02:35:31Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-12T05:27:48Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-20T18:54:37Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-20T18:54:37Z", "merge_commit_sha": "13e37d85ce79b4562a1efff0bcc6a91b9d1529f3", "assignee": {"login": "vy", "id": 72137, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjcyMTM3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72137?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/vy", "html_url": "https://github.com/vy", "followers_url": "https://ap